-
-<body>
-
-<footer>
-
-Types:
-- feat:     New feature
-- fix:      Bug fix
-- docs:     Documentation
-- style:    Formatting (no code change)
-- refactor: Code restructuring
-- test:     Adding tests
-- chore:    Maintenance
-- perf:     Performance improvement
