-## 9. Run State Machine & Execution Lifecycle
-
-Every external execution operates under an observable, fault-tolerant state machine:
-
-```text
-        [ REQUESTED ]
-              │
-              ▼
-      [ POLICY_CHECKED ] ──(Violation)──► [ REJECTED ]
-              │
-              ▼
-         [ PLANNED ]
-              │
-              ▼
-      [ PLAN_APPROVED ]
-              │
-              ▼
-        [ EXECUTING ] ────(Timeout/Crash)──► [ RETRY / FAILOVER ]
-              │
-              ▼
-     [ ARTIFACT_READY ]
-              │
-              ▼
-       [ VERIFYING ] ◄─────────────────────────┐
-         │         │                           │
-      (Pass)     (Fail)                        │
-         │         ▼                           │
-         │   [ REPAIRING ] ──(Attempt < 3)─────┘
-         │         │
-         │      (Attempt >= 3)
-         │         ▼
-         │   [ ESCALATED_TO_HUMAN ]
-         │
-         ▼
-  [ PROMOTION_GATE ]
-         │
-         ▼
-    [ COMPLETED ]
-```
