-           ▼
-┌──────────────────────────────────────┐
-│ SupremeAI Cloud (Render)             │
-│  Capability Registry:                │
-│  { id: "user_local_ollama",          │
-│    owner: user_id,                   │
-│    type: "llm",                      │
-│    scope: "user-only",               │
-│    online: bool }                    │
-│                                      │
-│  Router: simple task + user's        │
-│  own request → user_local_ollama     │
