-# 10. Phase 8 — SupremeAI MCP
-
-Roll out gradually.
-
-### Stage A — Read-only
-
-- resources
-- health
-- deployments
-- logs
-- metrics
-- capabilities
-
-### Stage B — Controlled actions
-
-- restart
-- deploy
-- rollback
-- approved configuration operations
-
-### Stage C — Approval-gated autonomy
-
-```text
-Observe
- ↓
-Analyze
- ↓
-Policy Check
- ↓
-Risk Classification
- ↓
-Approval if required
- ↓
-Act
- ↓
-Verify
- ↓
-Audit
-```
-
-MCP must never bypass backend authorization or policy.
-
