-# 13. Phase 11 — Capability Self-Creation
-
-Enable only after foundation reliability is strong.
-
-```text
-Capability Gap
- ↓
-Research
- ↓
-Design
- ↓
-Implementation
- ↓
-Tests
- ↓
-Security Scan
- ↓
-Sandbox Validation
- ↓
-Registration
- ↓
-Approval if required
- ↓
-Activation
- ↓
-Monitoring
-```
-
-Generated capabilities must be versioned, auditable and reversible.
