-    ├── RateLimitManager (fair usage per user)
-    ├── SECURED BY:
-    ├── SecurityDashboard (anomaly detection)
-    ├── LOGGED IN:
-    ├── AuditLogsPanel (complete audit trail)
-    └── CONSENTED VIA:
