-# 42. Golden Architecture
-
-```text
-                 SUPREMEAI CODE
-                       |
-              Project-owned interfaces
-                       |
-              Central Configuration
-                       |
-                Environment / Infisical
-                       |
-       +---------------+----------------+
-       |               |                |
-    Backend         Frontend        Integrations
-       |               |                |
-     DB/Redis       VITE_*          n8n/Storage/AI
-```
-
-The deployment flow becomes:
-
-```text
-Change service
-    ↓
