-   ├── Registry validation
-   ├── Drift detection
-   ├── Provider validation
-   └── Deployment validation
-   │
-   ▼
-Merge
-   │
-   ▼
-GitHub Actions
-   │
-   ▼
-Infisical
-   │
-   ▼
-Render / Firebase / Cloudflare / etc.
-   │
-   ▼
-Runtime verification
-   │
-   ▼
