-
-# 54. What Changes for the Admin?
-
-The admin moves from:
-
-```text
-manual infrastructure operator
-```
-
-toward:
-
-```text
-policy owner
-approval authority
-strategic supervisor
-```
-
-Instead of fixing every issue manually:
-
-```text
-SupremeAI detects
-→ diagnoses
-→ proposes
-→ requests approval when necessary
-→ executes
-→ verifies
-→ reports
