-
-PROVIDER_RATE_LIMITED
-PROVIDER_FAILED
-PROVIDER_RECOVERED
-
-USAGE_LIMIT_REACHED
-COST_THRESHOLD_REACHED
-
-PAYMENT_SUCCESS
-PAYMENT_FAILED
-
-SYSTEM_HEALTH_DEGRADED
-SYSTEM_HEALTH_RECOVERED
-```
-
-Do not make n8n workflow names the source of truth for event semantics.
