-
-- [ ] User routes work.
-- [ ] Admin routes work.
-- [ ] Deep links work.
-- [ ] Refresh works.
-- [ ] Role guards work.
-- [ ] Permission guards work.
-
-### Performance
-
-- [ ] Heavy modules lazy-loaded.
-- [ ] Admin bundle not eagerly loaded for users.
-- [ ] User heavy modules not eagerly loaded unnecessarily for admins.
