-# 22. Rollback Strategy
-
-At every phase:
-
-```text
-Current stable frontend
-        │
-        ├── migration change
-        │
-        └── validation
-             │
-        ┌────┴────┐
-        │         │
-      PASS      FAIL
-        │         │
-     continue   rollback
-```
-
-Do not remove old authentication or deployment infrastructure until the replacement has been validated.
-
