-# SUPREMEAI 2.0 — PRODUCT UI/UX + DASHBOARD COMPLETENESS MASTER PLAN
-
-Version: 1.0
-Date: 2026-08-28
-Repository: https://github.com/SaifulHaqueNiloy/supremeai
-Primary frontend: `frontend/`
-Design tokens: `packages/design-tokens/`
