-# Plan 9: Hybrid Polyglot Storage & Smart Caching
-**Status:** 🔄 **EVOLVED / ACTIVE IN SUPABASE + REDIS + QDRANT ARCHITECTURE**  
-**Completion:** ~95% (Postgres + Redis KV + Qdrant Vectors)  
-**Priority:** HIGH (P0 Data Tier)  
