-                                       ▼
-                              [7] VERIFY (Hermetic Tests + Net-Value Formula)
-                                       ▼
-                              [8] CRITIQUE (Devil's Advocate & Confirmation Bias Check)
-                                       ▼
-                              [9] LEARN & FEED BRAIN (Episodic + Negative Knowledge + Baselines)
-                                       ▼
