-# 10. Task State Machine
-
-Each autonomous task should have explicit state:
-
-```text
-RECEIVED
-↓
-UNDERSTANDING
-↓
-PLANNING
-↓
-CAPABILITY_CHECK
-↓
-PREPARING
-↓
-EXECUTING
-↓
-VERIFYING
-↓
-REPAIRING
-↓
-DELIVERING
-↓
