-# 5. W-05 — `dorny/paths-filter` missing `before` field
-
-### Observed
-
-The supplied logs contain:
-
-```text
-##[warning]'before' field is missing in event payload -
-changes will be detected from last commit
-```
-
-### Current source
-
-`ci.yml` uses:
-
-```yaml
