-
-## Phase 1 — GitHub Actions runtime modernization
-
-- [ ] Inventory every `uses:`
-- [ ] Identify Node-20-backed actions
-- [ ] Upgrade to Node-24-compatible releases
-- [ ] Pin exact SHAs
-- [ ] Preserve least-privilege permissions
-- [ ] Validate all workflow inputs
-- [ ] Run CI
