-
-# 6. Automation Event Model — Required Upgrade
-
-Current event model contains:
-
-```text
-workflow_key
-payload
-metadata
-```
-
-This is useful but incomplete for durable distributed automation.
-
-Add:
-
-```text
-event_id
-event_type
-schema_version
-timestamp
-source
-tenant_id
-trace_id
-actor_type
-actor_id
-idempotency_key
-payload
-```
-
-Example:
-
-```json
-{
-  "event_id": "uuid",
-  "event_type": "HITL_REQUIRED",
-  "schema_version": "1",
-  "timestamp": "ISO-8601",
-  "source": "supremeai",
-  "tenant_id": "tenant-123",
-  "trace_id": "trace-123",
-  "actor_type": "agent",
-  "actor_id": "agent-456",
-  "idempotency_key": "event-123",
-  "payload": {}
-}
-```
-
