-        P4_3["Phase 4C: Synaptic Memory Dream Cycle (Scheduled Pruning & Graph Sync)"]
-        P4_4["Phase 4D: Precognitive Watcher & Proactive Sentinel"]
-    end
-
-    P1_4 --> P2_1
-    P2_4 --> P3_1
-    P3_4 --> P4_1
