-# 27. Appwrite Messaging — Not Complete
-
-Current messaging layer has an Appwrite placeholder, not a verified real Appwrite messaging adapter.
-
-Therefore:
-
-```text
-Appwrite Messaging = NOT IMPLEMENTED
-```
