-# 📊 PART 1: COMPETITOR LANDSCAPE ANALYSIS
-
-## 🔥 Major AI Competitors (2025-2026)
-
-| Competitor | Market Position | Strength | Weakness (GOLA) | Pricing |
-|------------|----------------|----------|-----------------|---------|
